    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Notes.</h2>You will not be able to solve all the problems.<br>This is a nihilistic game.<br>No hints. You are on your own.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Rules</h2>Select a stage.<br>Tap to enter the password.<br>&gt;Tap to enter the password.<br>When the password you entered is correct, the key will be unlocked.<br>You can get items by clearing the stage... Extra.<br><br>Well, I don't think you can clear it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Other.</h2>This game is an early release version.<br>&gt;It will be updated if it is well received. In other words, there will be more hell to pay.<br><br>...distribution terms and conditions, etc.<br>&gt;Nothing in particular. Please use it for chatting!<br>&gt;However, it is a game of eternal emptiness.<br><br>Why did you make this game?<br>&gt;I got the idea when I saw a lottery ticket...<br><br>It's not funny.<br>&gt;Because it's nihilistic.<br><br>Can you clear all the stages?<br>&gt;I can clear all the stages because there are no bugs. But... What do you mean all the stages?<br>The odds are astronomical.",
